						<img width="640" height="445" src="https://www.justairguns.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glock17gen5-review-hero.jpg" class="owl-lazy img-responsive" alt="glock17gen5 review hero" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.justairguns.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glock17gen5-review-hero.jpg 640w, https://www.justairguns.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glock17gen5-review-hero-400x278.jpg 400w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" />											</div>
